<h3><u>Bhayaa muje bhool na jaana</u></h3>
                <div style="width:100%">
                                <p><div><strong>Bhayaa muje bhool na jaana</strong></div>

<div>&nbsp;</div>

<div>Sab phulo ke gehne me sawaari dulhan aaye.</div>

<div>Tum jese ho bas ese hi pyaari dulhan aaye.</div>

<div>&nbsp;</div>

<div>(Sar pe agar sehra sajana, Hatho pe kangnaa jo bandhana) x2</div>

<div>(Bhaya muje bhool na jaana) x2</div>

<div>&nbsp;</div>

<div>1. Fatema sugra ne ye akber ko likha hai,</div>

<div>Bhayi salaamat raho behna ki duwa hai,</div>

<div>Baad duwa dil me ye armaan basaa hai,</div>

<div>Masne de shaadi jo bichaana</div>

<div>Bhayaa muje bhool na jaana..</div>

<div>&nbsp;</div>

<div>2. Baba ki aggosh me me bhi to pali hu,</div>

<div>Bhaya teri ungli pakar kar me chali hu,</div>

<div>Kyu me tere chaawo se mehroom rahi hu,</div>

<div>Baba ki jab chawo me janna</div>

<div>Bhaya muje.</div>

<div>&nbsp;</div>

<div>3. Baba se kehna ke meri jald khabar le,</div>

<div>Toot na jaaye kahi baba meri saase,</div>

<div>Kataa nahi din na guzarti hai ye raate,</div>

<div>Khat mera baba ko sunana,</div>

<div>Bhaya muje..</div>

<div>&nbsp;</div>

<div>4. Bhaya teri baad jo din eid ka aya,<br />
<span  ke din eidi me gham mene hi paaya,</span></div>

<div>Mujko bhare gar ki judaayi ne rulaaya,</div>

<div>Dukh ye mera sab ko bataana,</div>

<div>Bhaya muje...</div>

<div>&nbsp;</div>

<div>5. Sunti hu kerbal ki bohot garm hawaa hai,</div>

<div>Amma se kehne ke ye sugra ne kahaa hai,</div>

<div>Phool sa asgar jo mera sath gayaa hai,</div>

<div>Dhoop se jab usko bachaana,</div>

<div>Bhaya muje...</div>

<div>&nbsp;</div>

<div>6. Behno ka dil jaane jigar hota hai bhayi,</div>

<div>Ankh geher ti hai jigar hota hai bhaayi,</div>

<div>Mere tarap ne ka asar ho ta hai bhayi,</div>

<div>Tum ho jaha mujko bulana,</div>

<div>Bhaya muje...</div>

<div>&nbsp;</div>

<div>7. Bhaya muje rehta hai har waqt ye ehsaas,</div>

<div>Bhool gaye kya muje mere chacha abbas,</div>

<div>Aye alam aye sakina ho mere paas,</div>

<div>Aas meri tor na jana,</div>

<div>Bhaya muje.</div>

<div>&nbsp;</div>

<div>8. Ama se kehna ke sakina ki kasam hai,</div>

<div>Faisela ab kabre se bimaar ka kam hai,</div>

<div>Der na ker na ke mere hoto pe dam hai,</div>

<div>Haat duwa ko jo uthana,</div>

<div>Bhaya muje.</div>
</p>